   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a quotient with numerator \\( e^{\\sin(5x)} \\) and denominator \\( 3^{x} \\), so the quotient rule comes first (equivalently, rewrite \\( f \\) as a product with the factor \\( 3^{-x} \\)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Exp",
               [
                  "Sin",
                  [
                     "Multiply",
                     5,
                     "x"
