               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Assemble the quotient rule: \\( f'(x) = 3^{- 2 x} \\left(5 \\cdot 3^{x} e^{\\sin{\\left(5 x \\right)}} \\cos{\\left(5 x \\right)} - 3^{x} e^{\\sin{\\left(5 x \\right)}} \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}\\right) \\).",
